# Bridge Units/Stream — commands, exit codes, wall times (2026-11-21b)

Working directory for all Lean runs: `code/tests/lean`
(`$env:PATH="$env:USERPROFILE/.elan/bin;$env:PATH"`).
Lean 4.35.0 (x86_64-w64-mingw32), core libraries only.  The library is built with
`moreLeanArgs = ["-DwarningAsError=true"]`, so `lake build` rejects warnings
including deprecations (both files set `linter.deprecated false`).

