Notes

* `lake build` is the acceptance check: it applies `-DwarningAsError=true`.
  Both modules build clean; there are no warnings, and neither file contains
  `sorry`/`sorryAx` (checked with `Select-String`).
* Earlier theorems in both files are unchanged; the additions are appended
  inside the same namespaces (`Metronome.Bridge.AccB`,
  `Metronome.Bridge.StreamB`).
* `Axioms.lean` is a scratch audit; its output is `axioms.txt` in this folder.
  The only non-standard axioms are `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`
  and the pre-existing `bv_decide` LRAT certificates of `AccB.rNext_bytes`
  (the byte-bank lemma written in the 2026-11-21a round).  No `sorryAx`.
* `git diff --quiet HEAD -- src` at the end of the work: exit 0 (no RTL change).
